openrsvp (0.1.0-0ubuntu1~noble1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: Rapid Serial Visual Presentation reader.
    - PDF main-text extraction with column detection and header/footer dedup
    - Mozilla Readability for HTML / URLs / EPUB cleanup
    - DOCX (mammoth), legacy DOC (word-extractor), TXT, Markdown
    - Spritz-style ORP highlighting, smart pacing, 1/2/3-word chunks
    - Per-document bookmarks, visual start-position picker

